# Smolweb gate-1 headed receipt: a real Gemini capsule enters through an
# address, spawns the registered Nematic gemtext session, and composites as a
# content surface. Network-dependent by design; run on a fresh scratch root.
settle 30
key escape
open gemini://geminiprotocol.net/
settle 60
assert visible
act Toggle live content
settle 60
assert content-live
assert surface content
capture 01_gemini_capsule

# Follow the first retained gemtext link. This exercises the same content-hit
# path as a person clicking it and proves that a Gemini-relative href becomes
# a new graph address rather than an unusable `/...` node.
click-at 600 363
settle 60
assert focused faq
assert snap node-count >= 14
act Toggle live content
settle 60
assert content-live
assert surface content
capture 02_followed_gemini_link
log smolweb Gemini browse receipt complete
